    {
      "id": "3.41.6",
      "label": "3.41.6",
      "numbers": [
        6
      ],
      "devanagari": "वध्याः खलु न वध्यन्ते सचिवाः तव रावण |\nये त्वाम् उत्पथम् आरूढम् न निगृह्णन्ति सर्वशः",
      "iast": "vadhyāḥ khalu na vadhyante sacivāḥ tava rāvaṇa |\nye tvām utpatham ārūḍham na nigṛhṇanti sarvaśaḥ",
      "translation": "\"Your ministers are not curbing you anywise when you scramble on a high road to self-ruination, hence they are indeed to be sentenced to death, but they are not being executed for their dereliction.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
