    {
      "id": "3.41.10",
      "label": "3.41.10",
      "numbers": [
        10
      ],
      "devanagari": "राज मूलो हि धर्मः च जयः च जयताम् वर |\nतस्मात् सर्वासु अवस्थासु रक्षितव्यो नराधिपाः",
      "iast": "rāja mūlo hi dharmaḥ ca jayaḥ ca jayatām vara |\ntasmāt sarvāsu avasthāsu rakṣitavyo narādhipāḥ",
      "translation": "\"The king alone is the root cause for probity and prosperity, isn't it. Therefore, oh, best prosperous one, in all situations the kings are to be safeguarded from the ill effects of influences.",
